l just... sat there. For a year it's been floating silently over the ocean, quietly observing how Earthlings live. Everyone's pretty much used to it by now.\n\nEveryone, that is, except the Magic User's Club. They're a small band of misfits who can do actual, honest-to-goodness magic! Their leader, Takeo, doesn't trust the aliens to stay peaceful. He wants to fight the alien menace, but it'll be a tough task when his club consists of a perverted president, a flamboyant VP, a flaky princess, a bumbling new recruit, and her temperamental best friend! Can this motley crew pull it together and save the world?\n\n(Source: Nozomi Entertainment)"},"tags":[{"name":"Magic","rank":96,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Witch","rank":86,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School Club","rank":82,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Unrequited Love","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Love Triangle","rank":76,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":74,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Aliens","rank":72,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Crossdressing","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Coastal","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"LGBTQ+ Themes","rank":68,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ojou-sama","rank":65,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Urban Fantasy","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Bullying","rank":52,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Femboy","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Magic User's Club!","english":"Magic User's Club!","native":"魔法使いTai!","romaji":"Mahou Tsukai Tai!","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"魔法使俱乐部"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"魔法使Tai!"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"宝贝魔法使"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Magic User's Club"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}